[{"title":"秋日泛舟怀友","author":"周文","text":"临风思永夕，极目感深秋。\n月落应同照，溪阴故独流。\n鸟啼清露下，雁过薄寒收。\n衰草犹如岸，空依此夜舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日和友人见赠并谢兰膏名酒二首 其一","author":"周文","text":"睡起独怜人，吟诗感叹频。\n蚕眠知入夏，溪涨觉馀春。\n搔首惭膏沐，停觞忆饮醇。\n蒹葭馀一水，何处问通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日和友人见赠并谢兰膏名酒二首 其二","author":"周文","text":"题遍碧苔笺，吟残绿水篇。\n流霞穿树出，明月隔溪悬。\n乍听声声笛，还逢泛泛船。\n琴心谁共识，山水自相怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀 其一","author":"周文","text":"卷帘何所思，独立数归鸟。\n不恨落日迟，惟怜君去早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀 其二","author":"周文","text":"醉罢见明月，照我还照君。\n如何君不见，只见天边云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春 其一","author":"周文","text":"曾共看花发，无端又落花。\n春归君亦去，谁与惜年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春 其二","author":"周文","text":"鸟声泣暮雨，蝶梦绕东风。\n花落不堪问，春光半已空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春 其三","author":"周文","text":"坐起愁如织，空斋但寂寥。\n不关风雨妒，春色为谁凋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春 其四","author":"周文","text":"堪嗟分手日，春色冷湖头。\n柳絮空飞尽，长条转系愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春 其五","author":"周文","text":"旧愁聊自息，新恨便相催。\n欲寄丝千织，无由只雁来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"周文","text":"两眼断夕阳，两鬓羞临镜。\n重门闭不开，唯与愁相竞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二十初度","author":"周文","text":"作恶春风二十年，愁眉常到镜台前。\n去年杨柳为谁折，今岁梅花黯自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成","author":"谢五娘","text":"乳燕衔泥春昼长，倚阑无语立斜阳。\n桃花红雨梨花雪，相逐东风过粉墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏 其一","author":"梁小玉","text":"松响翩清籁，泉声浣俗尘。\n白云堪赠客，明月解留人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"梁小玉","text":"霜杵舂清骨，风灯扬梦思。\n空山悬雨处，断浦落云时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其一","author":"梁小玉","text":"朱颜倏忽泣枯鱼，点点辞条著翠裾。\n幼女不知花有恨，闲凭绣砌笑轩渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其二","author":"梁小玉","text":"翠钿无数碎寒灰，冉冉寻芳细数来。\n同病相怜无限泪，红痕堕落锦千堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其三","author":"梁小玉","text":"爱看繁枝不忍删，欲留香魄杳无还。\n粘泥扑幕俱堪惜，简点残英乱晓鬟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其四","author":"梁小玉","text":"引领韶芳君最先，冰翰瓣瓣坠楼前。\n儿家惜玉情偏重，收拾馀香作枕眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其五","author":"梁小玉","text":"瑶林春意似云蒸，娇怯难支玉树零。\n剩绮馀芬还有韵，夜阑频点照花灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其六","author":"梁小玉","text":"春草春风遍地覃，偏他妒杀万红酣。\n粉销香减何人惜，只道儿家一味憨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠","author":"梁小玉","text":"宛转谁通九曲珠，最怜探海夜光枯。\n须知颗颗鲛人泪，能向龙颔取得无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珀琥枕","author":"梁小玉","text":"仙苓千载赤脂殷，雕琢移来湘簟间。\n从此不须沾小草，长陪清梦白云闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"包头","author":"梁小玉","text":"轻霞薄雾小香罗，傍著蝉鬟香更多。\n最爱春山缥缈上，横妆一带浅青螺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"篆章","author":"梁小玉","text":"挥洒霞笺寄陇头，双钤题处紫云浮。\n儿家曾掌司花印，总领曾城十二楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬诗以香","author":"梁小玉","text":"好事无如贾浪仙，常将酒脯酾诗篇。\n儿持净戒无荤血，飨尔蘅芜一炷烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四言","author":"素带","text":"郎明日别，妾心惙惙。\n愿作郎车，与郎共歇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五言","author":"素带","text":"妾作五言诗，试写梧桐叶。\n因风寄赠郎，期与郎相接。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其一","author":"羽素兰","text":"一自相从十八姨，春山游遍故枝移。\n扑帘时助娇娥绣，点砚常窥骚客诗。\n国色尚存衣带引，清香不改月明知。\n蝶来北苑蜂南去，谁向楼头话别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其二","author":"羽素兰","text":"昨日层冈今曲堤，乍看谁信旧成蹊。\n尽教拂掠随鸦阵，怪道颠狂伴燕泥。\n蔡琰忽惊归异域，西施空自忆耶溪。\n人间离合浑无定，兔去乌来到处迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其三","author":"羽素兰","text":"一凭风势自徘徊，吹堕东篱成锦堆。\n无语对人羞粪土，有情留别向莓苔。\n掉头犹望君王幸，舞袖还随歌扇开。\n谁道赵家身似燕，不飞金屋委尘埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其四","author":"羽素兰","text":"才向诗人又酒人，半留窗屋半铺茵。\n自来姣好根荄薄，却为轻狂转盼频。\n任是秾华迎淑景，也应飘泊到残春。\n青阳若得常如旧，子建何须赋洛神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其五","author":"羽素兰","text":"金粉漫天晓日暾，韶华冯尔寄残痕。\n沾衣不湿风如霰，点案无声蝶乱翻。\n身在红尘心恋树，朝依绿叶暮归根。\n人生聚散虽春梦，觉到抛离更断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其六","author":"羽素兰","text":"几回墙畔逐飞翰，分付流莺莫报欢。\n忆昔晓妆争日丽，而今夜雨又春残。\n每遭俗客呼童扫，曾得游人带笑看。\n惆怅红颜何处去，青山依旧路漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花 其七","author":"羽素兰","text":"匪爱春游学浪仙，一心常系故枝边。\n如奔似逐皆无奈，送雨迎风也可怜。\n遥望陌头悲柳絮，点残红叶乱云笺。\n离情不与春霞尽，翠雁钿蝉到处天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄远","author":"羽素兰","text":"绣户常相忆，阳台未有期。\n西风吹雁去，说向薄情儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招魂","author":"羽素兰","text":"白云无声山魈啼，桃花落地老鹰饥。\n苏台古冢夜凄凄，霜根石眼哭莎鸡。\n死字犹传梦里人，彭祖巫咸依旧春。\n海波不涸天不远，杜鹃枝上魂当返。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促梅","author":"杨宛","text":"风期今岁阻，幽抱竟难开。\n翰弱犹含冻，枝繁几暗猜。\n未能传信去，那得逗香来。\n自恨春相避，羞凭羌笛催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愁春","author":"杨宛","text":"不向花前为怯春，春风似也不怜人。\n明添愁绪阴添病，不分花枝自在身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人放纸鸢 其一","author":"杨宛","text":"共看玉腕把轻丝，风力蹉跎莫厌迟。\n顷刻天涯遥望处，穿云拂树是佳期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人放纸鸢 其二","author":"杨宛","text":"愁心欲放放无由，断却牵丝不断愁。\n若使纸鸢愁样重，也应难上最高头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人放纸鸢 其三","author":"杨宛","text":"羡伊万里度晴虚，自叹身轻独不如。\n若到天涯逢荡子，可能为报数行书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人放纸鸢 其四","author":"杨宛","text":"薄情如纸竹为心，辜负丝丝用意深。\n一自飞扬留不住，天涯消息向谁寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人放纸鸢 其五","author":"杨宛","text":"时来便逐浮云去，一意飘扬万种空。\n自是多情轻薄态，佳人枉自怨东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夜有感","author":"杨宛","text":"弦管千家沸此宵，花灯十里正迢迢。\n闲闺蓦地停杯忆，如许春光伴寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪","author":"杨宛","text":"性本若浮云，因风逐处纷。\n穿梅惊蕊落，乘柳讶花芬。\n离合终成水，联翩似结纹。\n虽难待明月，相对亦欣欣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日书梵经藏佛腹","author":"杨宛","text":"碧瓦云楸映半塘，静从秋色到修篁。\n聊存心力于经卷，不负闲身住草堂。\n微雨暗飘毫素润，轻风徐动墨池香。\n书成却恨无人识，故向真空密处藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"杨宛","text":"万里翩翩度碧虚，月明送影意何如。\n也知一向郎边过，自是多情少寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦还仙都幽踪宛若闲房寂然独贮玉砚有识书名云云可忆","author":"杨宛","text":"怨梦因无好梦成，昨宵忽得快平生。\n数间矮屋浮云外，几曲澄溪待月明。\n惊见道书新著蠹，怜馀半砚旧题名。\n文心一缕三生业，只恨清愁搅墨兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促织","author":"杨宛","text":"啛啛孤韵入秋林，切切幽心语夜深。\n惯不怜人成好梦，却凭好事戏相寻。\n在床在户身难主，添恨添愁巧自深。\n何不早从金笼住，傍人枕畔共哀吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏阁前柳","author":"杨宛","text":"初春无限意，况复近妆楼。\n不舞时如醉，参差乱若愁。\n风流费管束，绰约自难俦。\n肠断重门里，花飞逐浪浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"杨宛","text":"是事与心违，经旬未启扉。\n闲花随逝水，弱柳荡晴辉。\n燕子差帘箔，鱼儿长钓矶。\n年年当此际，病起怯春衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中","author":"杨宛","text":"坐卧掩虚堂，香风绕笔床。\n咏花生艳冶，题柳遂轻狂。\n事少人偏倦，情多梦不长。\n年年愁病日，却笑为诗忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事二首寄修微 其一","author":"杨宛","text":"东风堪赏犹堪恨，绽尽花来送尽花。\n可惜一庭深浅色，随风今去落谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事二首寄修微 其二","author":"杨宛","text":"东风同护曲阑中，一样花枝别样红。\n纵是不容春绾住，莫教狼藉宋家东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟泊黄河与止生舟隔两岸口占寄示","author":"杨宛","text":"恨打鸳鸯两岸飞，两心相望共依依。\n何如溪上眠沙稳，相逐相呼趁月归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄林子真秀才","author":"张璧娘","text":"黄消鹅子翠消鸦，簟拂层冰帐九华。\n裙缕褪来腰束素，钏金松尽臂缠纱。\n床前弱态眠新柳，枕上回鬟压落花。\n不信登墙人似玉，断肠空盼宋东家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧","author":"林子真","text":"梅花历乱奈愁何，梦里朱楼掩泪过。\n记得去年今夜月，美人吹入笛声多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三阁词 其二","author":"释宗泐","text":"槛车出城去，望阁暂回头。\n昔道千年乐，今成万古愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1315,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"谢五娘","text":"四面帘垂碧玉钩，重重深院锁春愁。\n天涯行客无归信，花落东风懒下楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1316,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太极图说赞","author":"曹端","text":"濂溪夫子，卓乎先觉。\n上承洙泗，下开河洛。\n建图立说，理明辞约。\n示我广居，抽关启钥。\n有条有要，有本有末。\n敛归一心，放弥六合。\n月白风清，鸢飞鱼跃。\n舜禹得之，崇高卑若。\n孔颜得之，困极而乐。\n舍此而为，异端俗学。\n造端之初，胡不思度。\n毫釐之差，千里之错。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1317,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会稽八景","author":"刘球","text":"烟霞覆深穴，兹景何辽阒。\n通灵彻两仪，吐瑞成五色。\n明烛方外晨，暝归岩底夕。\n藏书今有无，百世传禹迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1318,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其一 楞伽院","author":"沈大本","text":"林中禅寂地，古木丛青霭。\n当年结屋人，惆怅今何在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1319,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其二 南池","author":"沈大本","text":"丙穴暗泉通，清漪浸碧空。\n白莲秋未老，鱼戏叶西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1320,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其三 石室","author":"沈大本","text":"凿石客趺坐，还将石作床。\n山中当夏日，此处独清凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1321,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其四 八隔泉池","author":"沈大本","text":"不作方圆甃，池形似塔形。\n云光来复去，孤影湛亭亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1322,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其五 石门","author":"沈大本","text":"设户防来往，两崖相对青。\n山僧无一物，入夜不须扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1323,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其六 寒泉","author":"沈大本","text":"饮来如雪味，入口带天香。\n流出空山去，能令天地凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1324,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其七 马迹石","author":"沈大本","text":"支公有骏马，已骋千里道。\n留迹在空山，犹恋山中草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1325,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其八 南峰","author":"沈大本","text":"回峰带秋色，苍翠耸晴昊。\n涧底有寒梅，年年著花早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1326,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其九 待月岭","author":"沈大本","text":"入谷路已昏，远寺钟声歇。\n烟中人语喧，归樵待明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1327,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十 碧淋泉","author":"沈大本","text":"泉流苔石下，潆渟映空碧。\n上有疏篁枝，苍苍同一色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1328,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十一 放鹤亭","author":"沈大本","text":"放鹤人何在，孤亭横翠微。\n客来亭上坐，惟见白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1329,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十二 牛头峰","author":"沈大本","text":"懒随年共化，独卧空山里。\n时有牧童来，长鞭驱不起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1330,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗十首 其一","author":"王汝玉","text":"昔年十四五，猛志狭八荒。\n欲登昆崙巅，挥手攀扶桑。\n腰县倚天剑，身被拂云裳。\n出入在元始，顾瞻近三光。\n琅玕久不宝，灵鸟方高翔。\n吞声勿复道，感慨热衷肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1331,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗十首 其二","author":"王汝玉","text":"远游历燕赵，抚剑黄金台。\n昭王在何许，遗迹空蒿莱。\n是时穷秋后，朔漠悲风来。\n惊沙掩白日，六龙就西颓。\n羁怀无与欢，俯仰独徘徊。\n徘徊将安之，零泪曾沾怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1332,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]